{"item_uid": "指考100-biology-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 100, "year_ce": 2011, "subject_key": "biology", "subject_zh": "生物", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關光敏素影響植物生長與開花之敘述，哪些正確？", "options": {"A": "林下植物因為只能接受遠紅光，因此Pr的量一直偏低", "B": "萵苣的種子接受紅光照射後，Pfr會增加而促進種子萌發", "C": "陽性植物的幼苗在光照下，因為Pfr增加，而使節間不易伸長", "D": "短夜植物（長日照植物）葉部累積Pfr的量若高於臨界值，就會開花", "E": "長夜植物（短日照植物）若在連續黑暗期中照射紅光，則會因Pr減少而開花"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "BCD", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 49.0, "D": 79.0, "E": 28.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 89.0, "E": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 47.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 73.0, "E": 48.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 58.0, 43.0, 32.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
